<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the Gold Coast Classic women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat 1-Brenda</p>
<p>Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>6-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-2 6-4.</p>
</text>
